    "disclaimer": "<p>LIFENET Care and LIFENET Care App, is a data transmission system, designed to facilitate communication between EMS and hospital staff. LIFENET is not intended to be used to make remote diagnostic or patient care decisions—patient care decisions are made by the healthcare provider on scene based on actual patient assessment.</p>\r\n",
